=== Interpretation flag ===
"Folder" interpreted as documents surfaced under their linked entity via
document_entity_links (list_documents_for_entity — the Phase-9 query), NOT a
separate folder hierarchy. Consistent with the codebase (no folder tables exist).

=== Build ===
- services/document_linkage.py — linkage engine (Tasks 2-4). Reuses the picker
  helpers verbatim. created_by convention: human=user id, system K-1 auto-link=NULL,
  approval=reviewer id. Link tables are NOT bi-temporal -> insert/delete, ON CONFLICT
  DO NOTHING for idempotency.
- routers/document_links.py — 9 real endpoints (mounted /api/v1), auth/org-scoping
  identical to routers/documents.py (org_id from JWT, never body).
- routers/entities.py — extracted the two shared picker helpers; create_entity_stub
  now calls them (behaviour unchanged).
- main.py — registered document_links_router.
NOTE: Task-3 trigger is exposed as service fn auto_link_k1_document + endpoint
POST /documents/{id}/auto-link-k1. There is no natural in-pipeline call site because
Phase 3 (which would produce the completed K-1 extraction) is not built; Phase 3
should call auto_link_k1_document at K-1 completion.

